# PHP Coding Standards (Template)

- Declare `strict_types=1` and type every parameter, return, and property.
- Validate external inputs at boundaries before internal use.
- Keep files under 400 lines and functions under 30 lines.
- Bind query parameters; never concatenate user input into SQL.

